[0.0, "o", "\u001b[0m\u001b[31m \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[90mAsking claude to write the rule · 61s\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.004, "o", "\u001b[0m\u001b[31m \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  ---\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  description: A line must hold one statement, and an `if` or loop condition must be one check or a call to a named \r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  predicate; never put a body on its condition's line or join checks with `&&` or `||` inside a condition.\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  ---\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  A condition made of joined checks makes the reader work out what the checks mean together. A named predicate states\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  it. \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215mif (isAuthorized(user))\u001b[39m\u001b[49m says what \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215mif (user.isAdmin || content.visibility === \"public\" || content.shares.includes(user.id))\u001b[39m\u001b[49m only implies. Two checks\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  are enough to break the rule. That holds with or without braces, and with or without parentheses or a negation\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  around them, as in \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215mif ((name === \"Pick\" || name === \"Omit\") && isBuiltIn(name, environment))\u001b[39m\u001b[49m or \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215m\u001b"]
[0.0, "o", "[39m\u001b[49m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215mif (name === \"Record\" && isBuiltIn(name, environment))\u001b[39m\u001b[49m. A comparison, a call, and a property test each count as a\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  check.\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  A body on its condition's line puts two statements on one line, as in \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215mif (!entry.isDirectory()) continue;\u001b[39m\u001b[49m or \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215mif (found === undefined) return \"unresolved\";\u001b[39m\u001b[49m. It also hides a jump in control flow at the end of the line. Give the\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  body braces and a line of its own. Other statements on one line, such as \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215ma(); b();\u001b[39m\u001b[49m, break the rule too.\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  These are not violations:\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m    \u001b[36m• \u001b[0mThe returned expression of a named predicate function, which is where joined checks belong, as in \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m      \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215mreturn command.includes(\"/\") |"]
[0.0, "o", "| command.includes(\"\\\\\");\u001b[39m\u001b[49m.\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m    \u001b[36m• \u001b[0mA single check, including a negated check or a call with arguments, with its body on the following lines, as in \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m      \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215mif (!(error instanceof Error)) {\u001b[39m\u001b[49m.\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m    \u001b[36m• \u001b[0mA conditional expression that picks a value, as in \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m      \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215mconst resolvedPath = path.isAbsolute(ocxBin) ? ocxBin : path.resolve(baseDirectory, ocxBin);\u001b[39m\u001b[49m.\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[1m\u001b[36mMust\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m────\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m┌─ \u001b[0m\u001b[2m\u001b[3mts\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m\u001b[0m\u001b[35mexport\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[35mfunction\u001b[0m isPathLikeCommand(command: \u001b[0m\u001b[34mstring\u001b[0m): \u001b[0m\u001b[34mboolean\u001b[0m {\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m  \u001b[0m\u001b[35mreturn\u001b[0m command\u001b[0m\u001b[3m\u001b[1m.includes\u001b[0m(\u001b[0m\u001b[32m\"/\"\u001b[0m) || command\u001b[0m\u001b[3m\u001b[1m.includes\u001b[0m(\u001b[0m\u001b[32m\"\\\\\"\u001b[0m)\u001b[0m\u001b[2m;\u001b[0m\r\n "]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m}\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m\u001b[0m\u001b[35mif\u001b[0m (isPathLikeCommand(ocxBin)) {\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m  \u001b[0m\u001b[35mconst\u001b[0m resolvedPath = path\u001b[0m\u001b[3m\u001b[1m.isAbsolute\u001b[0m(ocxBin) ? ocxBin : path\u001b[0m\u001b[3m\u001b[1m.resolve\u001b[0m(baseDirectory, ocxBin)\u001b[0m\u001b[2m;\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m  \u001b[0m\u001b[35mreturn\u001b[0m Result\u001b[0m\u001b[3m\u001b[1m.ok\u001b[0m(resolvedPath)\u001b[0m\u001b[2m;\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m}\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m└─\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[1m\u001b[36mNever\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m─────\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m┌─ \u001b[0m\u001b[2m\u001b[3mts\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m\u001b[0m\u001b[35mfor\u001b[0m (\u001b[0m\u001b[35mconst\u001b[0m entry of \u001b[0m\u001b[35mawait\u001b[0m readdir(ROOT, { withFileTypes: \u001b[0m\u001b[33mtrue\u001b[0m })) {\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m  \u001b[0m\u001b[35mif\u001b[0m (!entry\u001b[0m\u001b[3m\u001b[1m.isDirectory\u001b[0m()) \u001b[0m\u001b[35mcontinue\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\u001b[2m;\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m  \u001b[0m\u001b[35mif\u001b[0m (entry.name\u001b[0m\u001b[3m\u001b[1m.startsWith\u001b[0m(\u001b[0m\u001b[32m\".\"\u001b[0m) || entry.name === \u001b[0m\u001b"]
